"<h2>Project Structure</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  features/&#x3C;feature>/   # Feature logic (e.g. apps.server.ts, apps.query.ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  components/           # Mantine UI components</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  routes/               # TanStack file-based routes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server/               # Nitro plugins, scheduler, services (SSH, Docker)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>templates/              # Marketplace templates (template.toml)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>drizzle/                # PostgreSQL schema migrations</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Coding Standards</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Formatter &#x26; Linter:</strong> <a href=\"https://biomejs.dev/\">Biome</a>. Run <code>bun run check</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Internationalization:</strong> <a href=\"https://lingui.dev/\">Lingui</a>. All user-visible strings must pass through <code>i18n._()</code>.</li>\n</ul>"